1
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,700
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,560
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,680
=Episode 11=

4
00:00:51,159 --> 00:00:51,920
Mr. Li.

5
00:00:52,079 --> 00:00:53,960
What's the password to my mom's safe?

6
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,200
Ms. Lin,

7
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,159
I don't know.

8
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,520
Tell me, or I'll kill myself!

9
00:01:02,399 --> 00:01:03,560
The password is...

10
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:16,719
(Prenuptial Property Agreement)

11
00:01:16,719 --> 00:01:17,640
(I don't want our child)

12
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:19,959
(to grow up in a family where
the father isn't accepted.)

13
00:01:19,959 --> 00:01:21,359
(That's not real love.)

14
00:01:21,359 --> 00:01:22,280
(And it's not a real family.)

15
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,239
(It wouldn't be fair to the child.)

16
00:01:23,239 --> 00:01:24,879
(Prenuptial Agreement)
(I don't want you to suffer!)

17
00:01:24,959 --> 00:01:26,760
(We signed a prenuptial agreement.)

18
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:27,920
(Divorce)

19
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:30,200
(would just mean signing another
piece of paper.)

20
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:30,879
I'm begging you.

21
00:01:30,879 --> 00:01:32,000
Please save my mom.

22
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,640
I want to save your mother.

23
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:35,799
But your mother never liked me.

24
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,280
She even forced me to sign
a prenuptial agreement.

25
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,920
(I finally got the agreement.)

26
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,239
(Honey,)

27
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:43,120
(you'll never have
to feel inferior again.)

28
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,760
(From now on, we can finally
live our lives in peace.)

29
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:51,120
I...

30
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:53,120
I need to go out for a while.

31
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:55,879
Where are you going?

32
00:01:56,599 --> 00:01:57,920
I thought about it all night.

33
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:00,400
I can't let you carry all of this alone.

34
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,079
Since Zhang Haotian wants to see me,

35
00:02:02,079 --> 00:02:03,359
I'll go meet him.

36
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:05,519
I think what you should be thinking
about now is

37
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:07,719
why Su Qinglan called you.

38
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,280
I don't know.

39
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,759
When I was at the Lin family,

40
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:12,159
I had never met her.

41
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,719
I never had any contact with her.

42
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,240
Besides, she's unconscious now.

43
00:02:16,639 --> 00:02:18,439
Maybe no one will ever know the truth.

44
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:22,159
I already have a foolproof plan.

45
00:02:22,159 --> 00:02:24,039
You don't need to get close
to Zhang Haotian anymore.

46
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:24,800
Mai.

47
00:02:25,199 --> 00:02:26,560
Only if I get close to him

48
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,759
and find his weakness

49
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:29,360
can we bring him down.

50
00:02:29,879 --> 00:02:31,879
I don't want to drag
this out any longer.

51
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,879
I want to end this once and for all.

52
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:36,919
I'm leaving.

53
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,000
How did it go with what I asked you
to do?

54
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,479
(This person is very cautious.)

55
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:52,280
(Hard to push further.)

56
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:55,759
(But I found something else
during the investigation.)

57
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,319
Tell me.

58
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:13,120
(5F)

59
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:19,360
(5F)

60
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,319
Miss Zhao, you came to see me?

61
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,599
Wasn't it you who said

62
00:03:27,759 --> 00:03:29,960
that if I wanted money,
I should come to you?

63
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,800
I'm here now. Pay me.

64
00:03:36,719 --> 00:03:38,520
If you keep acting like this,

65
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,680
the debt between us

66
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,960
will only keep growing.

67
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:44,840
For a woman like you,

68
00:03:47,479 --> 00:03:48,879
is love a luxury?

69
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:51,159
I don't understand love.

70
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,000
Do you?

71
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:54,520
Have you ever truly loved a man?

72
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,599
What about you?

73
00:03:58,199 --> 00:03:59,520
Have you ever truly loved a woman?

74
00:03:59,520 --> 00:03:59,960
Yes.

75
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,199
You.

76
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:06,919
I don't have time for this
little love game.

77
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,599
Pay me.

78
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:08,879
Haotian.

79
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,120
Haotian.

80
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,600
Mr. Zhang.

81
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:32,399
Your wife is here.

82
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:38,440
(5F)

83
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,120
What are you doing?

84
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:42,839
Nothing.

85
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,480
(Calling: Husband)

86
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,160
I just wanted to tell you
in the simplest way.

87
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,959
You are the love of my life.

88
00:04:57,800 --> 00:05:00,480
Love is a luxury I can't afford.

89
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,920
But as long as you

90
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,600
pay me enough money,

91
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,360
I can fool myself.

92
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:08,000
I can pretend that you truly love me.

93
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,920
(Calling: Husband)

94
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,560
Our tab between us

95
00:05:20,879 --> 00:05:22,160
was two items.

96
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:24,560
Now there's another one. Three in total.

97
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:28,160
Fill it in yourself.

98
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,519
Mr. Zhang,

99
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:43,000
we're even now.

100
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,800
I'd like to book another time.

101
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,800
Even someone like me, a woman
from the nightlife scene,

102
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:55,000
has her own preferences.

103
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:59,879
And clearly, Mr. Zhang,
you're not my type.

104
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,480
(Was Zhang Haotian
showing his true feelings,)

105
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:14,079
(or was he just putting on an act?)

106
00:06:14,839 --> 00:06:17,519
(Can Zhao Ke really
become your weakness?)

107
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,680
(Prenuptial Property Agreement)

108
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,839
Haotian, do you know how long
I've been looking for you?

109
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,920
If I hadn't heard your phone ringing,

110
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,399
I still wouldn't have found you.

111
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,399
Haotian.

112
00:06:37,319 --> 00:06:38,160
What's wrong?

113
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:39,720
Nothing.

114
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:42,360
I'm just worried about your mom.

115
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:44,439
And worried about you.

116
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,120
I just feel overwhelmed.

117
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:49,639
I came here to clear my head.

118
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,959
I brought the prenuptial agreement.

119
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:53,639
I brought your copy too.

120
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:03,560
(Scope of Premarital Property)

121
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:08,120
Let's go. We'll have it revoked
right now.

122
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,600
(Just as Planned)

123
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:17,240
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

124
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:20,120
♪I should forget you♪

125
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:25,360
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

126
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,320
♪To carry on♪

127
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:32,560
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

128
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:36,240
♪You no longer have the strength♪

129
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:41,040
♪You want me to go there for you♪

130
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:47,200
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

131
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:51,360
♪Your freedom♪

132
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:56,840
♪Has become my cage♪

133
00:07:57,560 --> 00:08:03,640
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

134
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:09,760
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

135
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:17,160
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

136
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:20,040
♪You told me♪

137
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:25,200
♪I would shine like a star♪

138
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:30,240
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

139
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:33,880
♪How to live without you♪

140
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:38,280
♪I look up♪

141
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:41,040
♪The starry sky♪

142
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:44,840
♪So hazy and blurred♪
